  validation,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/discovery.md,"Users, Roles, and Scenarios",181,2,"- Repository maintainer scenario: enables the MVP for a pilot, reviews evidence, adjusts or disables it, and preserves existing skill files and provider configuration."
  security,,specs-refiniment/003-context-guard-product-goal/prfaq.md,Context Guard targets AI-agent cache waste before coding work begins,197,2,"The first pilot will run in the Context Guard repository on Claude Code and Codex. Broader availability depends on proving that each provider exposes a supported control point before startup context is assembled, demonstrating repeatable sa"
